// RULE: the operator set is closed. Every theorem in Chapters 3 and 4 quantifies over it,
// so a stage outside it is a stage outside the results.
// WHY IT MATTERS: an unrecognised stage lowered to the identity, so the circuit silently
// did less than the source said and verified cleanly.
// EXPECT: NL0505
// STAGE: lower
view smoothed = postings.rolling_median(|p| p.amt)
    serve { consistency: snapshot, materialize: auto };
